license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  Public reproducibility package for the Walsh-Hadamard ECG anomaly-scoring study.
  This version adds a real-data PTB-XL pilot layer to the previous synthetic
  verification package. It includes code, a Colab notebook, real-data PTB-XL
  pilot outputs, tables, figures, operator-identity verification files, and run
  metadata. The manuscript itself is not included in this public archive because
  it is under journal submission. The PTB-XL pilot is intended as methodological
  real-data verification and stress testing of the Walsh-Hadamard quadratic
  reference operator; it is not claimed as clinical diagnostic validation.

